@* نوارِ پیشرفتِ باریک — ظرفیتِ فعال‌سازی، مصرفِ کد تخفیف و… *@
<div class="meter" role="progressbar" aria-valuenow="@Value" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="@Max"
     style="margin-top:5px">
    <span class="meter__fill @ToneClass" style="width:@Width%"></span>
</div>

@code {
    [Parameter] public int Value { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public int Max { get; set; } = 1;
    [Parameter] public string Tone { get; set; } = "auto"; // auto|brand|ok|warn|bad

    private double Width => Max <= 0 ? 0 : Math.Clamp(Value * 100d / Max, 0, 100);

    private string ToneClass => Tone switch
    {
        "ok"   => "meter__fill--ok",
        "warn" => "meter__fill--warn",
        "bad"  => "meter__fill--bad",
        _      => Max > 0 && Value >= Max ? "meter__fill--bad"
                : Max > 0 && Width >= 75  ? "meter__fill--warn"
                : "",
    };
}
